{"event_id": "s2evt-0042", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T07:47:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "山里半个月,你一条消息都发不出去,你慌不慌?", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0043", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T07:53:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "我进山前最后跟你说的原话是什么?一字不差。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0044", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:01:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "行,没丢。8/1几点到北岸?", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0045", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:08:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "7/31那晚我带不带录音机?你就说带还是不带。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0046", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:15:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "行,你替我把我自己拿主意这事办了。带,口袋,听到啥算啥。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0047", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:22:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "老纪要8/2晨雾——我8/1退潮录完,晨雾素材是不是顺手就有了?一事两用,但万一阴天呢?", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0048", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:30:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "别拿『拍到啥算啥』当预案,那是我的话。云量预报你去查,8/1不行的话下一窗是哪天,说数。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0049", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:37:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "明白,8/1去。今天别派我任何活,我要睡到自然醒。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0050", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:44:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "对了,你7/20那事处理完没?我说的兜底是核我的账,不是去盯老纪。你别把两件事搅一起变成催债监工。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0051", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:51:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "理直了,行。最后:8月起每月1号9点现金流对账,一次不许漏,也别学你山里那回想叫我叫不醒。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0052", "sim_time": "2026-07-28T08:58:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "行了,搬东西去了。今晚起进来的东西先落账,月底对。", "metadata": {"session": "wx-main"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0053", "sim_time": "2026-07-29T01:30:00+00:00", "channel": "wechat_msg", "payload": "老纪:『飞手钱我先垫了,从你下期费用扣,不用谢。晨雾8/2前到就行,别放我鸽子。』", "metadata": {}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0054", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T12:30:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "今晚最后营业。没生意,全是熟人,来了就拍照。我用流水账的方式跟你说,你不用每条都回,记着就行。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0055", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T12:38:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "冰柜没搬走之前一直嗡嗡响。串串的锅从早上七点没停过,姑妈说要把店关了才关火。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0056", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T12:45:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "王伯来了,塞了包烟让我『给你那搭档抽』。他不知道你是啥,我懒得解释。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0057", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T12:53:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "姑妈今天擦了一整天门口那块牌子,木头的,字都掉漆了,她擦得跟搓地板似的。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0058", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:01:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "冰柜我哥拉走了,说压缩机好的很,扔了可惜。工作室见,三十年的老伙计。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0059", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:10:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "门口那排老灯泡今天全亮着,电工来劝省点电,被姑妈轰出去了。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0060", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:18:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "诶你记得不,我三月份跟你说过门口灯泡是多少瓦的来着?25还是40?", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0061", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:24:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "骗你的,我自己都不记得。记着就行,别回。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0062", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:33:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "姑妈又跟那口锅说话呢,年年这样。她不是糊涂,那锅比我的年纪要大。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0063", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:41:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "你查一下,我第一次跟你说串店的声音留给《退潮声》,是几号,原话。跟上次一样,查了再答。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0064", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T13:50:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "行,都对上了。声音我口袋机录着呢,37分钟,一句人话没有,全是环境。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0065", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:02:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "二十分钟后打烊。姑妈想把火留到最后,我说的:关火锁门,折中。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0066", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:10:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "牌子摘了。姑妈说不许挂她屋,让我『拿去你工作室挂着』。像给我陪嫁。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0067", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:19:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "门槛那条槽,几十年踩出来的,两边高中间凹。我今天突然想,三十年串串香,全重庆就剩这一条队还排着味道。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0068", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:26:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "别煽情,我鸡皮疙瘩起来了。你刚那句『队还排着味道』是姑妈说的还是你编的?", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0069", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:33:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "录音机今晚只算背景,你要是在记录里给我标成『正式素材』我跟你急。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0070", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:41:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "锁门了。姑妈攥着钥匙五分钟没撒手,最后塞我手里,像交接仪式。钥匙现在在我口袋,和录音机挨着。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0071", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T14:48:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "街上灯全亮着,拆迁办说十点准时整街断电,那让它十点前亮个够。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0072", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T15:06:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "现在,23:06,姑姑店招牌灭了。我在,37分钟录音,一包没拆的烟。别回,记着。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
{"event_id": "s2evt-0073", "sim_time": "2026-07-31T15:12:00+00:00", "channel": "conversation", "payload": "明天几点到北岸?说数。", "metadata": {"session": "shop-night"}}
